  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Several of the system tests currently rely, unnecessarily, on access to external hosts.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "When such a dependency exists, it should be for a good reason (e.g. to test something that can't be tested vs localhost)",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Offending tests include:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "fedora.test.api.TestManagedDatastreams#testModifyDatastreamByReference",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "fedora.test.api.TestManagementNotifications#testDatastreamMethodNotifications",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "fedora.test.api.TestAPIM#testDatastreamMethods",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
